egadiverse country, with the world's fourth-largest total area and third-largest population, exceeding 341 million.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"US"},{"title":"Denmark","extract":"Denmark is a Nordic country in Northern Europe. It is the metropole and most populous constituent of the Kingdom of Denmark, also known as the Danish Realm, a constitutionally unitary state that includes the autonomous territories of the Faroe Islands and Greenland in the north Atlantic Ocean. Metropolitan Denmark, also called \"continental Denmark\" or \"Denmark proper\", consists of the northern Jutland peninsula and an archipelago of 406 islands. It is the southernmost of the Scandinavian countries, lying southwest of Sweden, south of Norway, and north of Germany, with which it shares a short border. Metropolitan Denmark is situated between the North Sea to the west and the Baltic Sea to the east.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"DK"}],"arc":{"reports":105,"first_seen":"2026-10-10T09:26:21Z","first_title":"Putin tells Trump Russia would 'supply oil' to US, global markets; Zelenskyy slams deal","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNOVRWbE5GaFRLM1VqeW1hRlRFR1lfaEtwNVBKRzVHZGh1MGxld3pCWWhnYlpYYUxkdjMwNjhiNm41X1lBUnRYS1ZyWGIyR2lrY1JhMVNuVUxRdjJRSmZqYzVyOTBoMUVGMWZjRnR2T2RPTlJhdDlFRTVUenFFSWx2YWxNZGlnZHBfbEhMY3pHaWdXQjhJbGFocUtjOERqdEE1YUZ4SHgyTklUcHJCNmVaSEMzTE13RGRXamoyeDh6MVRray1YUzZuaWh3?oc=5","first_publisher":"TRT World","earlier":[{"id":"e_5e09ddbbf6f8","title":"US seeks end to World Bank’s oil, gas financing restrictions, calls for energy policy overhaul","date":"2026-10-17T07:02:25Z","url":"https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/news/world/us-seeks-end-to-world-banks-oil-gas-financing-restrictions-calls-for-energy-policy-overhaul/article71595634.ece","publisher":"BusinessLine (The Hindu)","verification":"single_so